<template compat="shopify">
{%- comment -%}
  Materia Themes. Developed By Materia Themes.
  Renders a placeholder image. Accepts optional `class`.
  The picture is inline, so an empty image setting asks nothing of a
  third-party server.
{%- endcomment -%}
